            "memo": "(Referencing Figure 7 Labels): 1. Spring breakage or loss of tension. 2. Armature sticking to the Core (residual magnetism). 3. Burnt or open Coil (Coil Terminal failure). 4. Carbon buildup/pitting on NO or NC Contacts. 5. Mechanical failure of the Switching Element."
