            "n": "2.1",
            "text": "Whichphysical connectionstouse. How the connected computers should listen. How to interrupt. How to say goodbye.v (4×1) (4) Layer1: Physical transmits raw bits over a physical medium and enables communication between devices.V Layer 2: Data link breaks data into frames for transmission.Italsodetects and corrects errors in frames.v Layer3: Network determines the best path for data transmission and assigns IPaddressestodevices.V Layer4: Transport not only breaks down and reassembles data packets but alsoregulates data flow to prevent congestion.v Layer5: Besidesmanaging theconnection,sessionalsosetsupand tears downconnections.It also establishes a connection between devices.Vv Layer 6: Presentation translates data into a compatible format and encrypts ittoensuresecurity.Inaddition,presentation compresses data to reduce transmission time.v Layer 7: It not only supports email,filetransfer,andwebbrowsingbutalso enables communication between apps and network services.V√ (7 ×2)",
