            "n": "4.4",
            "text": "Thetwo-handed control is used to prevent any injuries such as crushing.The operation employs the indirect method of manual control,wherethecontrol relay(R1)willcontrol the solenoidvalve(1M1).WhenPB1and PB2are depressed simultaneously,the cylinder will extend,andwhenthetwopush buttonsarereleased,thecylinderwill retract.",
